	(text "Carpet sensor driver: one low-side AO3400 + 330R pull-up from VUSONIC-14V4 (14.4 V). The P-FET half-bridge was removed:\nits 100k gate pull-up could not turn it off at 290 kHz (shoot-through). R186 holds LO low in reset/flash.\nDrive LO in short bursts only: LO stuck high puts 0.63 W into R185.\n\nC174 AC-couples LO to the Q18 gate: if LO sticks high, the gate decays through R186 (~10 ms)\nand Q18 turns off, so R185 is never stressed by firmware holding LO high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.822 66.548 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
